	[ Command summary ]


^A: Scroll left	   ^N: Divide line
^B: Previous word  ^O: Insert line
^C: Line head	   ^P: Paste
^D: Down Scroll	   ^Q: Search next
^E: Erase till EOL ^R:  [INS]
^F: Next word	   ^S: Scroll right
^G: Copy line(s)   ^T: Window tail
^H:   [BS]	   ^U: Up Scroll
^I:   [TAB]	   ^V: Line tail
^J: Link line	   ^W: Page up
^K:   [HOME]	   ^X:  [SELECT]
^L: Delete line	   ^Y: Yank
^M:  [RETURN]	   ^Z: Page down

ESC    : Indirect command
SELECT : Search & Replace

Hit any key !!

    [ Indirect command summary ]


 LOAD   :  LOAD a file.
 SAVE   :  SAVE a file.
 APND   :  APPEND to a file.
 CLR    :  CLEAR edit buffer.
 DIR    :  Display DIRECTORY.
 DSKF   :  Display DISK STATUS.
 HELP(?):  Display HELP file.


*  Indirect command can be invoked
  by hitting ESC key.


Hit any key !!

	[ Search & Replace ]


[Search] (s)

  Invoke SEARCH and ask Target strings.

[Replace] (r)

  Invoke REPLACE and ask Source and
  Target strings.

[Direction] (d / f / b)

  Change SEARCH and REPLACE direction.
    (d:f->b,b->f  f:front  b:back)

*  Search & Replace command can be
  invoked by hitting SELECT key.

Hit any key !!

      [ Function key summary ]


   F01 : Go to top of file
   F02 : Go to tail of file
   F03 : Search strings
   F04 : Replace strings
   F05 : Search next strings

   F06 : Help
   F07 : Load a file
   F08 : Save a file
   F09 : Display directory
   F10 : Display disk status


Hit any key !!

